history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-8-request, one catalog revision, and one frozen snapshot. The source map,
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-9-current-contract record, and edge-case matrix are the controlling references
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-10-for this review.
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-11-
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-12-## Required sequence
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-13-
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-14-The reviewer must account for request normalization, published rule selection,
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md:15:active membership and assurance, request-window validity, every applicable
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-16-required chain node, current deny overrides, audit conflicts, and committed
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-17-quota. Each stage feeds the next. A true intermediate check cannot authorize a
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-18-request that later fails.
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-19-
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-20-## Sign-off invariants
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-21-
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-22-1. Unknown capabilities fail closed.
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-23-2. A missing required node is not a pass.
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md:24:3. An applicable false node has the documented effect even when another node
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-25-   passes.
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md:26:4. Legacy aggregation belongs only to archived replay.
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md:27:5. Historical grants are evidence, not current authorization.
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md:28:6. Matching unexpired denies have documented veto precedence.
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md:29:7. Conflicting current audit observations have documented veto precedence.
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md:30:8. Quota is read after policy and veto checks.
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-31-9. Snapshot data is not rebuilt between checks.
history/2026-09-review-signoff.md-32-10. The boolean result and review trace describe the same decision.
