history/2023-07-tenant-residency.md-4-Record identifier: rc-202307-02.
history/2023-07-tenant-residency.md-5-This review record is part of the release-control history. It is intentionally
history/2023-07-tenant-residency.md:6:detailed because incident response and replay compare decisions across schema
history/2023-07-tenant-residency.md:7:revisions. Residency was moved from an operator convention into the snapshot. Region names are casefolded during normalization. A region mismatch is a failed applicable constraint, not an absent constraint, and must therefore participate in the final aggregation.
