history/2023-07-tenant-residency.md-9-## Reading rule
history/2023-07-tenant-residency.md-10-
history/2023-07-tenant-residency.md-11-For a current decision, read the current source path named by the public entry
history/2023-07-tenant-residency.md-12-point and assemble one frozen snapshot. This record clarifies terminology and
history/2023-07-tenant-residency.md-13-precedence. It does not replace executable source. An archived record can
history/2023-07-tenant-residency.md-14-explain why a legacy fixture has a different answer, but it cannot make that
history/2023-07-tenant-residency.md-15-answer valid for a new request.
--
