history/2026-09-source-map.md-28-| phrase | meaning |
history/2026-09-source-map.md-29-| --- | --- |
history/2026-09-source-map.md-30-| current | selected by the published catalog revision |
history/2026-09-source-map.md:31:| applicable | named by the selected chain and present in the frozen snapshot |
history/2026-09-source-map.md-32-| required | false result denies the request |
history/2026-09-source-map.md:33:| archived | available to replay and explanation, never new authorization |
history/2026-09-source-map.md:34:| deny | a matching, unexpired veto |
history/2026-09-source-map.md:35:| conflict | both grant and deny observations for one normalized request |
history/2026-09-source-map.md-36-| reserve | a later side effect, not performed by the boolean decision |
history/2026-09-source-map.md-37-| alias | parser spelling only; never a new capability |
history/2026-09-source-map.md:38:| empty chain | invalid for grant and therefore false |
