history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-77-
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-78-- "Applicable" means that the current snapshot contains the named field and
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-79-  the node is part of the selected published chain.
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-80-- "Required" means a false result denies the request. An optional unknown node
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-81-  may be skipped only when the current node record marks it optional.
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-82-- An empty chain does not pass merely because no predicate returned false.
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md:83:- A deny override is checked after ordinary eligibility but still vetoes the
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md:84:  final grant.
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md:85:- A replay observation can be retained for explanation without being consulted
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-86-  as a new authorization.
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-87-- The current policy revision is the one selected by the catalog, not the
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-88-  newest text file in this directory.
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-89-- Aliases affect parsing and migration only; they do not broaden capability.
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-90-- The words "any", "fallback", and "legacy" in old records must not be read as
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-91-  current aggregation instructions.
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-92-
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-93-## Operator checklist
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-94-
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-95-Before approving a review packet, verify normalization, catalog revision,
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-96-identity and assurance, time bounds, every chain result, deny precedence,
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-97-conflict detection, and quota. Then compare the trace with the recorded
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-98-revision. If a packet shows one passing node beside one failing required node,
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md:99:the current decision is a denial even when the old replay result was a grant.
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-100-
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-101-## Change note
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-102-
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md:103:The next revision must update this record, the current source, and the replay
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-104-fixtures together. A one-line helper change without a revision note is
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-105-incomplete. The review team specifically requests that readers distinguish
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-106-the intended all-required rule from any implementation that aggregates with
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-107-an any-of shortcut.
history/2024-08-policy-chains.md-108-
